{
  "about": "The cases of the Captured repositories match. They run in the solidtrace CLI (cli/capture/repository_cases_test.go) and in EventStore (event_store/captured/captured_test.go), so that the two copies of the rule cannot drift. matches: the result of Matches(entry, repository) in both modules. clones: one git clone each. Claude Code 2.1.323 sent the url from it in cco-01, unless measured is false. remote is the clone's origin remote, and repository is the CLI's name for it (Normalise). url is the vcs.repository.url.full that Claude Code sends from the clone, and url_names are EventStore's names for it (URLNames). For each entry, sessions says if the entry captures the clone's Agent sessions (Matches with repository), and telemetry says if it keeps the clone's telemetry (Matches with one of url_names).",
  "matches": [
    {"entry": "bitbucket.org/acme/shop", "repository": "bitbucket.org/acme/shop", "match": true},
    {"entry": "bitbucket.org/acme/*", "repository": "bitbucket.org/acme/shop", "match": true},
    {"entry": "bitbucket.org/acme/*", "repository": "bitbucket.org/acme-tools/shop", "match": false},
    {"entry": "bitbucket.org/acme/*", "repository": "bitbucket.org/acme", "match": false},
    {"entry": "Bitbucket.org/acme/shop.git", "repository": "bitbucket.org/acme/shop", "match": true},
    {"entry": "  bitbucket.org/acme/shop  ", "repository": "bitbucket.org/acme/shop", "match": true},
    {"entry": "bitbucket.org/acme/shop", "repository": "BitBucket.org/acme/shop.git", "match": true},
    {"entry": "github.com/SomeOwner/Some-Repo", "repository": "github.com/someowner/some-repo", "match": true},
    {"entry": "github.com/someowner/some-repo", "repository": "github.com/SomeOwner/Some-Repo", "match": true},
    {"entry": "github.com/SomeOwner/*", "repository": "github.com/someowner/some-repo", "match": true},
    {"entry": "github.com/acme/shop", "repository": "github.com/acme/shop-api", "match": false},
    {"entry": "gitlab.com/acme/shop", "repository": "github.com/acme/shop", "match": false},
    {"entry": "gitlab.com/group/*", "repository": "gitlab.com/group/sub/example-repo", "match": true},
    {"entry": "gitlab.com/group/sub", "repository": "gitlab.com/group/sub/example-repo", "match": false}
